{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询重写(Query Rewriting)技术详解\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n在 RAG 系统中，查询重写（Query Rewriting）有哪些常见技术？HyDE（假设文档嵌入）的原理是什么？各自适用于什么场景？\n\n## 答案\n\n查询重写是 RAG 检索前优化的关键技术，目的是**缩小用户查询与文档内容的语义鸿沟**，提高检索召回率。\n\n**常见查询重写技术：**\n\n| 技术 | 原理 | 解决的问题 | 示例 |\n|------|------|-----------|------|\n| **同义扩展** | 添加同义词、近义词 | 词汇不匹配 | \"手机发热\" → \"手机发烫、过热\" |\n| **语义重写** | 口语化→规范化 | 表述不规范 | \"这玩意儿好用吗？\" → \"产品用户体验如何？\" |\n| **对话历史融合** | 结合上文消歧 | 指代不明 | \"续航多少？\" → \"Model Y 续航多少？\" |\n| **问题分解** | 复杂问题拆分为子问题 | 多跳推理 | \"比较A和B的优缺点\" → 分别查A和B |\n| **HyDE** | 生成假设答案再检索 | 查询-文档语义鸿沟 | 见下方详解 |\n| **后退提示** | 具体→抽象→再推理 | 信息不足 | \"北京房价多少？\" → \"一线城市房价趋势\" |\n\n**HyDE（Hypothetical Document Embeddings）详解：**\n\nHyDE 的核心思想是：**先让 LLM 生成一个假设性的理想答案，然后用这个假设答案的向量去检索真实文档**。\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">传统 RAG：<br>\n用户查询 ──Embedding──▶ 查询向量 ──▶ 向量检索<br>\n问题：用户查询和文档的语义空间可能不一致</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">HyDE：<br>\n用户查询 ──▶ LLM 生成假设答案<br>\n\"量子计算在药物研发中的应用\"<br>\n──▶ \"量子计算通过模拟分子结构，加速新药研发...\"</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">  假设答案 ──Embedding──▶ 假设向量 ──▶ 向量检索真实文档<br>\n优势：假设答案的语义更接近文档内容</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import HypotheticalDocumentEmbedder\n\n# 创建 HyDE Embedding\nhyde_embeddings = HypotheticalDocumentEmbedder.from_llm(\n    llm=ChatOpenAI(),\n    base_embeddings=OpenAIEmbeddings(),\n    prompt_key=\"web_search\"  # 使用预置 Prompt\n)\n\n# 使用 HyDE 进行检索\nresults = vectorstore.similarity_search(\n    \"量子计算在药物研发中的应用\",\n    embedding=hyde_embeddings  # 使用 HyDE Embedding\n)\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Multi-Query（多查询扩展）：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>retrievers<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>multi_query <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> MultiQueryRetriever\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 让 LLM 生成多个查询变体</span>\nmulti_query_retriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MultiQueryRetriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    retriever<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>base_retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 输入一个查询，内部生成多个变体并行检索</span>\nresults <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> multi_query_retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"苹果新品\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 内部可能生成：</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - \"Apple 2024 发布会\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - \"iPhone 16 配置参数\"</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - \"苹果秋季新品\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>各种技术的适用场景：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>不推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>HyDE</strong></td>\n<td>查询表述与文档差异大</td>\n<td>需要严格事实准确性的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Multi-Query</strong></td>\n<td>召回率要求高</td>\n<td>延迟敏感的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>问题分解</strong></td>\n<td>复杂多跳问题</td>\n<td>简单单点问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>对话历史融合</strong></td>\n<td>多轮对话</td>\n<td>单轮查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: HyDE 生成的假设答案不准确怎么办？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 1) 设置相似度阈值，假设答案与文档相似度过低时回退到原始查询；2) 使用更准确的 LLM 生成假设答案；3) 结合 Rerank 层过滤不准确的结果。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 查询重写会增加多少延迟？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 取决于技术：同义扩展几乎无延迟；HyDE 需要一次 LLM 调用（~1-2s）；Multi-Query 需要多次检索。生产环境需要权衡效果与延迟。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>所有查询都需要重写</strong> — 简单明确的查询不需要重写</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>HyDE 一定更好</strong> — HyDE 依赖 LLM 生成假设答案的质量，如果生成错误反而影响检索</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>查询越多越好</strong> — Multi-Query 的查询数量需要控制，过多会增加延迟和噪声</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q18&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q18: 生产环境中 RAG 系统的性能优化有哪些策略？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q18: 生产环境中 RAG 系统的性能优化有哪些策略？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}